2026-07-27T11:23:49.5417171Z i /tmp/RtmpXmnsVc/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5417699Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5418311Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5419065Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5419948Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5421589Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:23:49.5422779Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
